<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33740" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλκ-έω</span></b> ,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλκω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drag about,
				tear asunder</i>, in impf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέκυν . . εἵλκεον ἀμφότεροι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					17.395
				</span></i>
			: also in fut. and aor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύνες ἑλκήσουσιν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				558
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὲ μὲν κύνες ἠδ᾽ οἰωνοὶ ἑλκήσουσ᾽</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					22.336
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λητὼ γὰρ ἥλκησε</span> he
				<i>did</i>
			<i>violence to</i> Leto, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.580
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. τινὰ πέπλοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arat.
					638
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλκηθείσας τε θύγατρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.62
				</span></i>
			.</div>
